{"4610580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Apocalypse Jumpers", "steam_appid": 4610580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Apocalypse Jumpers</i> will throw you headfirst into the end of the world… again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through different apocalyptic scenarios, from scorched wastelands to lava fields and more. Choose from a ragtag crew of unlikely heroes, each with their own abilities and playstyles, and build them into unstoppable forces of destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together devastating attacks to fight off the hordes and adapt on the fly as each battlefield throws new threats your way. Push deeper into the unknown to uncover what’s really causing the collapse of reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump is a new chance to survive—or fail spectacularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullet heaven third-person combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergize abilities, unleash powerful attacks, and dominate overwhelming battle arenas.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610580/extras/f0d348dbcf76cf6ced3fd5ad7f563c0c.poster.avif?t=1787163286\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610580/extras/f0d348dbcf76cf6ced3fd5ad7f563c0c.webm?t=1787163286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610580/extras/f0d348dbcf76cf6ced3fd5ad7f563c0c.mp4?t=1787163286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A crew of misfit heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as unique characters, each with a distinct starting ability and passive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_